WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.710
Good morning!

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:05.650
So what do you want?

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.010
I'm Hanashima Masaru.

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:08.110
A player from the J League!?

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.610
Yes!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:13.960
What? We have sunk so low that we need two fifth grade brats?

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.010
The Momoyama Predators have started up again!

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.620
We were unable to find the 
eleventh player, but Reika-chan joined.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.080
We also entered the district 
preliminaries for the city tournament.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.460
What's wrong?

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:03.430
Yo, Furuya-kun.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.160
It's Kageura, huh?{I remember you're Kageura? }

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.560
What do you want?

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:11.350
I heard that you're going back to the Predators, so I'm here to cheer you on.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:12.900
Cheer us on?

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:16.830
The Amarillos are a seeded team, so we don't play until the real city tournament.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.200
We'll be waiting for you there.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:23.960
It's strange how we haven't played once yet.

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:24.950
You too?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.370
Yes.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.500
The Heavens have already qualified the district preliminaries.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.360
You want revenge for last year?

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:33.710
Wow.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:40.360
Amarillos' Emperor, Kageura-kun, is here to cheer us on himself.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.950
Isn't he an idiot?

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:42.640
Huh?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:46.340
There's no way we'll lose during the prelims.

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:49.650
There's no way he'll come all 
the way here just to cheer us on.{He must not be all there to come all the way here to cheer us on. }

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:53.530
Your "Emperor" nickname will only last until you play us.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:54.940
Better enjoy it while it lasts.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:58.760
All nations led by an emperor are doomed to fail.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:01.180
My condolences.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.370
Later.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:07.200
I will pay you back personally this year.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.460
You better prepare yourself.

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:13.820
Hey! You!

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:16.930
Jeez, those triplets.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.090
Sorry about that. You came all the way here.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.390
Hey, you guys! Wait!

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.680
Kageura-kun! Aoto-kun!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:35.820
We'll make sure to qualify the 
prelims and enter the city tournament.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.280
We'll see each other then!

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:47.720
So I'll let you educate the triplets.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.990
They're so cocky.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.750
What's wrong with him?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.750
Kota, calm down.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.120
Kota-kun?

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.030
Yeah.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.500
It's because he met Aoto-kun.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.960
Oh yeah, last year...

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.040
Yeah.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.030
We did beat the Heavens,

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:08.220
but Aoto-kun scored all three of their goals.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:11.810
Kota-kun didn't like that at all.{Kota-kun didn't think that was any fun. }

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:15.380
So he lost his own personal matchup, eh?

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.400
Probably.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.290
Tactics?

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.740
Yes. You must've thought of something, right?

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.770
No, I haven't.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:38.040
We start with doing whatever we like.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.250
That won't do.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:43.340
We must go to the city tournament.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.700
You have no confidence?

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.520
What!?

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:51.430
What we want to say is that this team is not complete.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.890
We won't win just by doing whatever we like.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.400
We have a heavy burden.

00:04:57.350 --> 00:04:59.190
You don't have to put it like that!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:03.360
We are able to play in the tournament because Reika-chan joined!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.280
Yeah! She's our teammate.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:09.040
That's why we're worried.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.990
Coach, you know that too, right?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.250
Have you heard the saying, "The ball is round?"

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.080
Well, just think about it.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.080
Reika-chan, don't worry too much about it.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:25.240
Yeah! The Predators exist because of you.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:32.790
Welcome home, Ojou-sama.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.230
I'm home, Matsushima-san.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.480
Oh? Welcome home, Reika.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:38.850
I'm back, Mama.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:43.070
You're early. Didn't you have piano lessons today?

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:48.820
Yes... The teacher had something to attend to, so it ended early.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.870
Oh, really? That's fine.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.660
I'm off to the beauty parlor.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.480
Oh, okay.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.980
Ojou-sama.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:00.800
Do you have anything to put in the laundry?

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.830
I'm fine today.

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:06.240
Matsushima-san, please take care of things here.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:09.390
Take care! I've told them to bring the car around.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.260
Thank you.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:17.740
I've hid your sports slacks from yesterday at the usual place where your mother can't find them.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.150
Thank you, Matsushima-san.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.240
We have a heavy burden.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.840
Let's see...

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:48.080
I'll have the triplets be the core of our offense.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.910
Don't eat the triplets!

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.210
What's this about triplets?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.810
Peanuts come in two, right?

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.330
I had only eleven peanuts!

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.070
Just eat the squid instead!

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:04.160
Jeez, what have you been doing?

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:07.400
I'm thinking about the Predators' formation.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.510
Oh?

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:12.840
That's great.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.560
Huh? What?

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:17.340
You agreed to be their coach.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:21.000
You used to spend this time watching TV and getting drunk.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:25.740
Then you'd snore like a smelly old man.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:26.980
Smelly?

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:30.550
You're still smelly, but it's a manly smell.

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:34.470
What? Stop saying I'm smelly.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:38.200
It's fine. I'm saying that you look cool now.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.420
Guys always need to be focused on something, after all.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:42.440
Keep it up.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.020
Hey!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.180
Those persimmon seeds are the opponent players!

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.610
Jeez! I give up! I give up!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.000
That won't do.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.150
Do your best for those kids.

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:57.750
Come on! Do your best, Masaru-chan!

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:01.750
Oh, shut up.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:22.100
Oh? Looks like you're quite getting into this.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.120
Tch. Still no good, eh?

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:43.580
Saionji-san, if you are afraid of the ball, you can't play soccer.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.490
Okay!

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:06.550
I'll be teaching you three formations today. Practice them well.

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:09.320
Oh? You did think of some.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:10.850
What kind of formations?

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:13.950
Wait up. Don't get so excited.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.040
Are you okay?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:20.950
Y-Yes.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.830
You'll have to run even more during matches.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.870
If you don't raise your stamina, 
you'll collapse in the middle of a match.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:30.090
I-I'll do my best!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:34.190
Really? I'll have you work on a special training menu, then.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:38.040
You can take breaks if you want, but run five more laps.

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:41.930
If you keep that up, your body will feel lighter and your stamina will get better.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.100
Okay!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.190
All right.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.270
The rest of you practice these formations.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:50.980
Kubota, can you be the goalkeeper?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.160
Okay!

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.770
The remaining nine players, form three groups.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:59.570
Rotate between playing forwards, midfielders, and defenders.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.490
Eh? Me, too?

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:04.170
Of course.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.520
We don't have substitutes.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:11.000
Everyone has to be able to play any position.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.340
Yes!

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:17.170
Then we'll start with Yoidon.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.720
Yoidon?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:23.430
To make it even shorter, Yoi.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.390
Yoi means to kick and rush.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:30.700
When we get the ball, we punt it forward.

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.820
Everyone then rushes after the ball.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.140
The forwards can attack however they want.

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:38.240
They can also pass to oncoming teammates for an assist.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.910
Well, things like this happen, too.{Well, that's what happens sometimes. }

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.100
The second tactic is the Big Triangle.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:47.030
In short, the Big Tri.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:52.250
The Furuyas split up and pass to each other using the width of the pitch.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.920
They split up the defense and then shoot.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.250
The last tactic is Buildup.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.970
In short, Build.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:05.000
The central midfielder is the commander and starts off a string of short passes,

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.810
and the team moves closer to the opponent's goal.{The team moves closer to the opponent's goal this way. }

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.730
Stop!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:13.110
Who will the opponent mark the hardest here?

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.850
Kota-kun, probably?

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:15.920
That's right.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:19.040
They'll mark the person with the best shooting ability.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.540
Then what will happen?

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.320
I'll be open!

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.010
That's right.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:26.420
Someone will become open for sure.

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:30.010
If you pass there, all that's left is the shot.

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:32.270
Practice again with that in mind.

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:33.540
Okay!

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:38.250
Are you done?

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.590
Y-Yes.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.320
Take a deep breath.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:44.070
Then you can start kicking the ball.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.150
U-Um...

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.120
Hmm?

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:53.340
I have a favor to ask of you.{I have something I want to ask you. }

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:54.470
What?

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:57.480
Please kick the ball at me as hard as you can!

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.940
Eh!?

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:07.340
Hey!

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:07.950
Go!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:08.910
Focus!

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.620
Please!

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:14.570
Even if you ask me, I can't just kick the ball at you with full strength.

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:16.390
Please!

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:18.320
If that's the case...

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.700
Wait right there.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.090
Okay.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.100
You just closed your eyes, didn't you?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.080
Yes...

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.680
That's no good!

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:37.060
If you don't look at the ball, 
it becomes even more dangerous!

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:39.820
Did that hurt?

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.920
No...

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:41.780
See?

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:46.030
But if a flat ball like that hits your nose, it'll still hurt a lot.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.740
You may even get a nosebleed.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.750
If you aren't looking, the ball might end up there.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:57.960
If you are going to make contact with it,
 make sure it's with a solid part of your body.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:01.240
So you need to keep your eyes on the ball.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.310
Okay.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:06.470
All right. Let's start with some slower balls, then.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.390
Okay!

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.240
Reika-chan?

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.940
W-Wait!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.310
I'm opening the door.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.240
What's the matter?

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.300
It's nothing.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.170
I'm just getting ready to sleep.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.370
What do you need?

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:30.510
Yes, yes.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.620
What happened to your piano recital this year?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:37.620
Eh? The recital is... still some time away.{Eh? The recital is coming up! }

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:42.130
Really? I thought it was always this time every year.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.220
You're mistaken, Mama.

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:46.590
I see. Really?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.760
Yes.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.620
I guess so.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:52.360
Good night, then.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.720
Good night.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:03.750
I ordered my dress already!

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.880
R-Really?

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:14.410
Big Tri!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:18.670
Kota!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:21.590
Ryuuji!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:25.210
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.340
Tomorrow's the match. How are they holding up?

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.890
Just take a look.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:31.680
Yoi!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.840
Nice save!

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:48.390
Reika-chan, it's okay if she blows past you. But at least put out a leg.

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:53.050
We can't make it back on defense if you don't stall the opponent a bit.

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.410
I'm sorry.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.120
Saionji.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.600
Will that girl be okay?

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:04.100
She can run five laps and doesn't close her eyes anymore.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.090
She has improved.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:09.000
That's fine, then.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.930
Let's do that Yoi again.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.060
What did he just say?

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:17.430
I don't know. Just take a look and you'll see.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.550
Over here!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:33.910
Reika-chan! Just keep that up and we'll get the time to move back to defense!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.120
I see.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.420
"Become a wall," I see.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.040
It'll probably work only once though.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.690
You want her to improve her confidence, right?

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:49.110
Well, if she doesn't have any confidence on the pitch, we'll be screwed.

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:52.760
But that confidence is flying away.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.810
There's no point if the wall runs away.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:10.010
No, there is a point.

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.070
Okay!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.910
Take a break! Gather around, everyone!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.410
The manager has something to say.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:19.160
Did you come to get in the way of our practice again?{Are you bothering our practice, again? }

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.530
What are you saying?

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:26.380
I used my own money and bought you all some uniforms!

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:29.000
Really? You're not bad, old man!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.010
Tomorrow is your long-awaited match-

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:38.330
Hey. We don't care about formalities. Just give us our uniforms.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.850
You still can't read the atmosphere, can't you?

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.400
What?

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.900
What are you doing?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.650
That's right. Let's get this started.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.610
H-Hey! You guys!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:55.160
Eh? The designs are the same as before.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.750
Hey! Where are your "thank you"s?

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.050
Thank you very much!

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:02.620
Reika.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:06.720
Cheer up. You didn't close your eyes back there, didn't you?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:10.920
That's a huge improvement. Keep your chin up.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.100
Okay.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:17.470
I had yours custom made. It cost a bit extra.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:20.010
I had to haggle quite a bit.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.680
Treasure it.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.230
Thank you very much.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.500
You still aren't happy with this?

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:32.700
Reika is your teammate. Admit that already.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:34.490
She just wants to diet, right?

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:37.130
Don't worry about him.

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:40.480
Just keep your confidence up.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.990
Okay! Go back to practice!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:47.050
Do some light exercise and we'll meet tomorrow for our match.

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:48.210
That's all I have to say.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.360
You're on, Captain.

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:54.420
Eh? Me?

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.760
Do your best tomorrow, Captain!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:02.720
Okay.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.570
By captain, you mean the head of the team, right?{The captain is the top dog, right? }

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.030
So, you're like, the Prime Minister?{So you're the president, right? }

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:10.010
The word is different, though.

00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:12.570
It's okay.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:16.020
Anyway, I'm proud of you.

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:20.940
You aren't just playing in the match, but you are the captain! The Prime Minister!

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:26.120
Yeah. I can't believe it myself, but that's great, Onii-chan.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.400
Eat up and do your best tomorrow!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.000
Yes!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.430
I'll eat steak together with katsu!

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:40.290
Then I'll "katsu" tomorrow!

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:41.800
Just kidding.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:52.190
Ronaldo-sama! Please let me win tomorrow!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:32.870
How can I drink if I have to win?

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:37.120
If you keep on winning, you'll never able to drink!

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.360
That'll be bad.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:44.120
I guess I'll drink it now!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.590
Good morning, Erika-chan!

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:07.350
You're taking your dog for a walk this early?

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.820
What are you doing here, too?

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:13.710
I was so excited that I couldn't sleep at all.

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:15.280
I was doing some jogging.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.440
The same reason?

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.630
You too, Erika-chan?

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:20.190
Whatever!

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:22.530
That's...

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.240
Reika-chan!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.920
Good morning.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:31.700
Forget about that. You're practicing this early?

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.760
Yes.

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:36.720
I don't want to be everyone's burden.

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:39.510
No one thinks that.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:41.590
But Kota-kun...

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:45.440
He's just like that. Just ignore him.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.910
Anyway, I'll practice with you.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.040
Thanks.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.530
You tagging along?

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:53.130
Of course!

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:55.690
Isn't that the Furuyas?

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:56.520
You're right.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.690
Hey!

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:04.720
How rare to see you up so early. 
Are you two practicing with her?

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:08.870
You guys knew about Reika-chan's practice?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.870
Yes. She does it every morning.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.750
Then why haven't you recognized Reika-chan already!?

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.500
Kota-kun.

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:19.990
I... I love soccer!

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:22.310
I... I love soccer!

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:26.180
I want to play soccer with everyone more than dieting!

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.180
So I want you to accept me as your teammate!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:33.800
Kota-kun. How about an answer?

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.150
Stand over there.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:44.670
Reika-chan.

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:46.860
Can you wait a bit, Kota-kun?

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:51.470
Is this okay? Kota-kun won't hold back.

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:24.330
Wow!

00:22:24.330 --> 00:22:26.300
Reika-chan! You did it!

00:22:27.420 --> 00:22:29.490
Kota-kun accepts you now.

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:31.620
That's great, Reika-chan.

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:34.720
Now there's nothing to be afraid of!

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:37.200
Are you okay, Reika-chan?

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:40.650
Yes. I'm just a bit tired.

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:42.130
Hey!

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:45.090
What? You guys couldn't sleep either?

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:47.580
Everyone's here now.

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:50.730
I feel like we can do anything.

00:22:50.730 --> 00:22:54.050
Right, Captain? What do you say?

00:22:54.050 --> 00:22:56.370
Everyone, time for morning practice!

00:22:56.370 --> 00:22:57.860
Okay!

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:02.640
Eh? No one on our team slept last night? Is that okay?

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.080
We did.{We're not like that. }

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:38.420
Ahaha! The district matches are finally starting!

00:24:38.420 --> 00:24:41.030
I'm so nervous! Ahahaha!

00:24:41.030 --> 00:24:42.410
Now's not the time for that!

00:24:42.410 --> 00:24:45.280
Captain, do something about the triplets!

00:24:45.280 --> 00:24:46.460
Hey, hey!

00:24:46.460 --> 00:24:47.960
What's wrong, everyone?

00:24:47.960 --> 00:24:51.040
Are we in a pinch already!?

00:24:51.040 --> 00:24:54.800
Next time on Ginga e Kickoff!! "Kickoff!!"
